title: "How FrontierJS is tested — FrontierJS"
description: "FrontierJS is new. Here is what runs before anything ships: one CI you can run yourself, the installed app tested rather than the monorepo, 26,000 tests, schema mutation testing, and ratchets that only move one way."
render: static
---
