      <a href="https://github.com/frontierjs/frontierjs/blob/main/invariants.snapshot.md">the invariants and their enforcers</a> ·
      <a href="https://github.com/frontierjs/frontierjs/blob/main/VERIFYING.md">how we know something is true</a>
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

